#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0312 expect=noViolation domain=ADAE
# Rule:Description: SMQzzSC is not equal to BROAD or NARROW, where zz is a zero-padded two-digit integer [01-99]
#note "SMQ01SC=BROAD is in [BROAD,NARROW] -> noViolation"
# Declared-tier scope: the class= declaration disagrees with the columns, so #define must
# carry it to RuleRunner (ScenarioDeclaredScopeProvider.install).
#define standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADAE class=OCCDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col ASEQ type=Num
col SMQ01NAM type=Char
col SMQ01SC type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | 1 | Cardiac | BROAD
---
